# Source declaration = availability: every source has a precondition.
bars
  bands "nothing running,files on disk,a booted installation,network reach"
  axis "Required machine state"
title "Every source has a precondition"
description "The five sources a TYPO3 Support App tool can answer from, plotted against how much of the machine has to be running. Bundled knowledge and the server's own checkout answer with nothing running; installed packages need files on disk; the installation source needs a booted installation; network sources need outbound reach."

row `knowledge`
  sub "Bundled and version-bound."
  segments 4
  emphasis
row `checkout`
  sub "This server's own repository."
  segments 4
row `packages`
  sub "Files read, never executed."
  segments absent=1 3
row `installation`
  sub "Assembled runtime state."
  segments absent=2 2
row `network`
  sub "Official live services."
  segments absent=3 1

legend
  ink "available"
  absent "the state this source still needs"
